#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:3
#: 898136ececc14d56b38e8fc4a9bdd83a
msgid "定向空位（Targeted Vacancy）"
msgstr "Targeted Vacancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:5
#: b10545ba3af84ab3a29abd7ac1e63a16
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:7
#: b0c6c01081ef42ecbfecd3d3e197bca8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:9
#: fd47f463f3c04b909f2b0c9f044495ab
msgid "按“元素 + 可选 group + 删除数量”规则选择候选原子，再随机删除具体位点。适合只生成某种元素、某些原子层或已有区域标签内的空位。"
msgstr ""
"Select candidate atoms using rules composed of an element, an optional "
"`group`, and a removal count, then randomly choose the specific sites to "
"remove. This is suited to generating vacancies only for a particular "
"element, atomic layer, or pre-labeled region."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:11
#: f20c76bbd2e44a788289ba77559436c1
msgid "**定向空位：** 每条规则有自己的元素、group 和数量范围。"
msgstr ""
"**Targeted Vacancy:** each rule has its own element, `group`, and count "
"range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:12
#: c53f3df423f84714bb16600b2801402b
msgid "**全局空位：** 所有原子共同采样，按整体数量或比例删除。"
msgstr ""
"**Global Vacancy:** sample all atoms together and remove an overall count"
" or fraction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:13
#: a685f2cf726f471c917ba2090821b3eb
msgid "**随机占位：** 改变位点上的元素，不删除原子。"
msgstr ""
"**Random Occupancy:** change the element occupying a site without "
"removing the atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:15
#: dd5d5a7283614632b32b0a5bbd7a8909
msgid "输出保留剩余原子的坐标、晶胞、PBC、逐原子数组和结构信息。"
msgstr ""
"The output preserves the coordinates, cell, PBC, per-atom arrays, and "
"structure metadata of the remaining atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:17
#: 352ca2b8c56949219ff4619cbfd49f5f
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:19
#: 4a8d70f2a8484e7ebdd2c0598d5be8bb
msgid "第 $r$ 条规则先得到候选集合"
msgstr "Rule $r$ first constructs the candidate set"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:21
#: a523b5c6b8094b4babea00e5e91f5771
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I_r=\\{i\\mid Z_i=Z_r\\ \\text{且}\\ g_i\\in G_r\\},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I_r=\\{i\\mid Z_i=Z_r\\ \\text{ and }\\ g_i\\in G_r\\},\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:25
#: 53e2ea54f6e648e48371cc7cc3cd4672
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其中 group 条件 $G_r$ 可留空。固定数量直接使用 $n_r$；随机范围先在整数闭区间 "
"$[n_{r,\\min},n_{r,\\max}]$ 中抽取 $n_r$。随后从当前仍可用的候选集合中无放回抽取位点。"
msgstr ""
"The group condition $G_r$ may be left empty. A fixed count uses $n_r$ "
"directly; a random range first draws $n_r$ from the closed integer "
"interval $[n_{r,\\min},n_{r,\\max}]$. Sites are then sampled without "
"replacement from the candidates still available."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:27
#: 4ff68502702d40f290459df43d27063d
msgid "单条固定规则最多有"
msgstr "A single fixed-count rule has at most"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:29
#: 1dba87299b37493097527128869a9ad6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\binom{|\\mathcal I_r|}{n_r}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:33
#: 8cfa1f6a88514a7eb74c014d37256751
msgid "种删除组合。多条规则按界面顺序执行；若候选池重叠，后面的规则只能使用前面尚未删除的原子，因此预览显示的是组合数上限，实际唯一输出可能更少。所有结果按删除位点集合去重，并保证至少留下一个原子。"
msgstr ""
"possible removal combinations. Multiple rules run in interface order. If "
"their candidate pools overlap, a later rule can use only atoms not "
"already removed by earlier rules, so the preview is an upper bound on the"
" number of combinations and the actual number of unique outputs may be "
"smaller. Results are deduplicated by their sets of removed sites, and at "
"least one atom is always retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:35
#: cb1c8af9ff774a8bb0f8da62bb10fe0d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:37
#: 0f933fc158034bccb9eec28acb10aa0e
msgid "只生成表面氧空位"
msgstr "Generate Surface Oxygen Vacancies Only"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:39
#: 720e844547ef460c9407f988cea52a2e
msgid "输入结构含 `group=surface/bulk`。设置一条规则："
msgstr "The input structure contains `group=surface/bulk`. Add one rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:41
#: 70841c642f4944bf8267d46e61780220
msgid ""
"元素：O\n"
"已有 group：surface\n"
"数量模式：随机范围\n"
"数量：1–3\n"
msgstr ""
"Element: O\n"
"Existing group: surface\n"
"Count mode: Random range\n"
"Count: 1–3\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:48
#: 19e218a6f269457b901f1cd0b23dcd29
msgid ""
"将“每个输入最大输出数”设为 20。首帧预览会显示匹配的表面 O 数量、删除范围和输出上限；运行后每个结果删除 1–3 个表面 O，并追加 "
"`Vac(n=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"Set `Maximum outputs per input` to 20. The first-frame preview shows the "
"number of matching surface O atoms, the removal range, and the output "
"upper bound. After the run, each result has 1–3 surface O atoms removed "
"and receives a `Vac(n=...)` label."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:50
#: 5d3126dbabcf4a049c51b00e7bf96baf
msgid "若要同时删除 1 个 Li，可再添加一条 Li 规则。两条规则若使用同一候选池，界面会提示实际输出可能低于组合数上限。"
msgstr ""
"To remove one Li atom at the same time, add another rule for Li. If two "
"rules use the same candidate pool, the interface warns that the actual "
"output count may be below the combination upper bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:52
#: 55abac2f784941b09eec45f2af443910
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:54
#: c6b97774c7e14aefabf22bd63f47edb4
msgid "空位规则（rules）"
msgstr "Vacancy Rules (rules)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:56
#: f81f406473474b86a0ab651f11171ba4
msgid "`list[dict]`，默认空列表。每条规则包含："
msgstr "`list[dict]`, an empty list by default. Each rule contains:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 3d954922766a4c039e10cbdf5444dbde
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 0c7344413a714808b61d551c9df8e36a
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 6d2474037f7844d7a556dc97cbdf9c1f
msgid "`element`"
msgstr "`element`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: b4badf2ffe244b638bf64b2915678a18
msgid "要删除的元素，如 `O`"
msgstr "Element to remove, such as `O`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: a5285648930c40818841fea02f6b69b9
msgid "`group`"
msgstr "`group`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 915348df4f9d48338b6f298a4b637079
msgid "可选；输入中已有的一个或多个 `group` 标签"
msgstr "Optional; one or more existing `group` labels in the input"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 1bb4ea4c86cd4ad68fc982c297aa08a4
msgid "`count_mode`"
msgstr "`count_mode`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 6436dad4f11d4faf80f4d7a6f7fc5938
msgid "`fixed` 或 `random`"
msgstr "`fixed` or `random`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: a5ceaea81681438b93789411c903ddd6
msgid "`count`"
msgstr "`count`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 3663455cacc14bc484ce35f0a386fc50
msgid "固定数量写 `[n,n]`；随机范围写 `[min,max]`"
msgstr "Use `[n,n]` for a fixed count and `[min,max]` for a random range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:65
#: 31f9452ed9684d749ab462327ddb6ad4
msgid ""
"固定数量至少为 1。随机范围的最小值可以为 0；抽到 0 时，该规则不删除原子。如果所有规则都抽到 0，原结构会作为一个唯一输出保留，且不会追加 "
"`Vac` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"A fixed count must be at least 1. The minimum of a random range may be 0;"
" drawing 0 means that rule removes no atoms. If every rule draws 0, the "
"original structure is retained as one unique output and no `Vac` label is"
" appended."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:67
#: 8811ec56e1624334b5e567be8722067d
msgid "最大结构数（max_structures）"
msgstr "max_structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:69
#: 4242413823ec44c798b64b24f3434437
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入最多保留的唯一空位结构数。候选组合不足、规则重叠或随机尝试重复时，实际输出会更少。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The maximum number of unique vacancy structures "
"retained per input. The actual count may be smaller when there are too "
"few candidate combinations, rules overlap, or random attempts repeat a "
"previous result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:71
#: 3fa8845d84df48ce85c274b2fa1c49d1
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:73
#: f88553afd1ac4a48bd6b6e042ae4f92b
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同输入结构和参数产生相同删除结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, the same input structure and "
"parameters produce the same removal results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:75
#: 329e0789ae714179b907286b576ab33e
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:77
#: 3eb7e286e2af4aa88830bae1551874cc
msgid "`int`，默认 0，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时使用。种子会结合结构内容派生，因此不同输入帧不会机械删除相同的原子序号。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, used only when `use_seed=true`. The seed is combined "
"with the structure content, so different input frames do not mechanically"
" remove atoms with the same indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:79
#: 7146bba408aa416587884003d53030be
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:81
#: 167c5cffe121436ca2e0e29eb74d22fd
msgid "`原子层分组 → 定向空位`：只在交替原子层中的某一组删位。"
msgstr "`Layer Groups → Targeted Vacancy`: remove sites only from one group of alternating atomic layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:82
#: ceb1c0a6bd524084ac66bc50b5fab714
#
msgid "`扩胞 → 定向空位`：先增大晶胞，降低周期空位镜像间的相互作用。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell → Targeted Vacancy`: enlarge the cell first to reduce "
"interactions between periodic vacancy images."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:83
#: 3cc778835356432794f34cf0d9f62b29
msgid "`定向空位 → FPS 代表性采样`：大量生成后筛选代表性构型。"
msgstr "`Targeted Vacancy → FPS Sampling`: select representative configurations after generating a large set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:85
#: 3f2005edcc8c4d079fdfe81bfbd7fac0
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:87
#: ae78e6ba70484d8c968c3e053290ce91
msgid "**填写 group 后提示输入没有 group 数组。** group 必须由输入结构或上游卡片提前写入；不需要区域限制时清空该字段。"
msgstr ""
"**The interface says the input has no `group` array after a group is "
"entered.** The `group` array must already be present in the input or be "
"written by an upstream card. Clear this field when no regional "
"restriction is needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:89
#: b3297c691dfd492f898839a1388c409b
msgid "**预览显示“组合数上限”。** 多条规则共享候选原子时，不同抽取顺序可能得到相同的最终删除集合，因此实际唯一输出通常更少。"
msgstr ""
"**The preview shows a `combination upper bound`.** When multiple rules "
"share candidate atoms, different sampling sequences can produce the same "
"final set of removed sites, so the actual number of unique outputs is "
"often smaller."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:91
#: 78360da8358e4629be42e45b89903376
msgid "**随机范围从 0 开始时为什么出现原结构？** 0 表示该规则本次不删除原子。若不希望保留原结构，把范围最小值改为 1。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the original structure appear when a random range starts at "
"0?** Zero means that the rule removes no atoms in that draw. Set the "
"range minimum to 1 if the original structure should not be retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:93
#: 500013ca74614fc6b35c0af28308e1b8
msgid "**为什么运行失败而不是自动减少删除数？** 请求数量超过候选数或会删空整个结构时，程序明确失败，避免生成与参数不一致的数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the operation fail instead of automatically reducing the "
"removal count?** When the requested count exceeds the number of "
"candidates or would remove every atom, the operation fails explicitly "
"rather than generating data inconsistent with the parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:95
#: 365de7cac1bb429d9ec6e1bb7c23c664
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:97
#: 959cf6bea0174885bb48a62ed9d032db
msgid "实际删除原子时，`Config_type` 追加："
msgstr ""
"When atoms are actually removed, the following is appended to "
"`Config_type`:"

